### Quiz rules for the intro screen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quiz
Accept: application/json

### All questions (never contains the correct option)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quiz/questions
Accept: application/json

### A fully correct submission -> 1000 points, passed
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quiz/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": "q01", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q02", "optionId": "b" },
    { "questionId": "q03", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q04", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q05", "optionId": "b" },
    { "questionId": "q06", "optionId": "d" },
    { "questionId": "q07", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q08", "optionId": "b" },
    { "questionId": "q09", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q10", "optionId": "b" },
    { "questionId": "q11", "optionId": "d" },
    { "questionId": "q12", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q13", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q14", "optionId": "b" },
    { "questionId": "q15", "optionId": "b" },
    { "questionId": "q16", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q17", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q18", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q19", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q20", "optionId": "c" }
  ]
}

### Exactly 600 points -> fails, because passing requires more than 600
### (q01-q07 correct: 3 x 100 + 4 x 75 = 600)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quiz/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": "q01", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q02", "optionId": "b" },
    { "questionId": "q03", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q04", "optionId": "c" },
    { "questionId": "q05", "optionId": "b" },
    { "questionId": "q06", "optionId": "d" },
    { "questionId": "q07", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q08", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q09", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q10", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q11", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q12", "optionId": "b" },
    { "questionId": "q13", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q14", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q15", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q16", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q17", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q18", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q19", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q20", "optionId": "a" }
  ]
}

### Invalid: q12 offers only a, b and c, so "d" is rejected for this question
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quiz/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": "q01", "optionId": "a" },
    { "questionId": "q12", "optionId": "d" }
  ]
}

### Invalid: empty answer list
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quiz/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": []
}
